    "description": {
      "content": "openFDA is an Elasticsearch-based public API serving FDA data on drugs, devices, foods, animal/veterinary products, and tobacco. Each noun exposes one or more categories (adverse events, recall enforcement reports, labeling, classification, registration, etc.).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: openFDA\n Email: open@fda.hhs.gov",
